{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:17 2026-11-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:17 2026-11-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:17 2026-11-28 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88762932cd518ead1aa298555285a416/2026-11/915586021_1192654889974490_2516621448252861698_n.jpg\"/><p>香港海關今日（28日）在鑽石山活水公園參與由黃大仙區撲滅罪行委員會主辦的「齊心滅罪在大仙」社區宣傳活動，透過設立互動遊戲攤位及犬隻示範，向市民宣傳打擊私煙訊息及「完稅標籤制度」。</p><p>活動期間，海關人員在攤位安排了拼圖遊戲及抽獎環節，以生動有趣的方式向公眾講解相關法例，提醒市民切勿購買或售賣私煙，並呼籲大眾若發現懷疑私煙活動，應主動向海關舉報。</p><p>此外，海關搜查犬亦到場進行示範，向在場市民展示嗅查違禁品的專業能力，吸引不少市民駐足觀看。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1544c34683b2a92df60897a0b7b3e539/2026-11/920479671_1192654813307831_9163067395375754511_n_1_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc8c68e688947a38e0322b03fdbc36b7/2026-11/914250154_1192654973307815_4882612603583008491_n.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ae2a5e503fc994f226b10edd0cbee7e/2026-11/923175296_1192654823307830_7870626081462010916_n.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/144865d42526c3a4b801c2afb4860494/2026-11/923723111_1192654896641156_4744771251112533499_n.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98d9ac1f7c4bee30748756f7efcdc58c/2026-11/915586021_1192654889974490_2516621448252861698_n_0.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T14:40:00.356531+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T14:17:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:55:28.547679+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T14:33:28.099197+00:00","content_hash":"645eef8fb263dfaa40a2309f01b1873ef23677a024771915cac198a2bd4dc70c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}